{"id":278252,"title":"02 | 内容综述","content":"本课程系统讲解 Flink 实践原理，涵盖从基础概念到生产运维的全链路知识体系。课程首先梳理 Flink 的应用场景、发展历史及流计算核心概念，并详解其在 Kubernetes 等主流资源管理器上的部署策略。核心内容深入 DataStream API 编程模型，剖析转换算子与 StreamGraph 生成机制；重点阐释有状态计算原理，解析 State 管理与 Checkpoint 容错架构。针对复杂数据处理，课程介绍 Flink SQL 接口在窗口计算及 Table Connector 中的应用。在运行时层面，深度解构 ResourceManager、Dispatcher、JobManager 及 TaskManager 等集群组件的交互逻辑与作业提交流程。运维方面，聚焦 Checkpoint 指标与反压监控，提供集群调优实战指南。此外，课程还覆盖 CEP 复杂事件处理与 DataFunction 等扩展组件，最终通过推荐系统综合项目整合全栈技能，助力学员掌握将 Flink 应用于实际生产场景的核心能力。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":244365,"user_name":"hello🧃🪀🪀🪀","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1608054,"ip_address":"","ucode":"057255C843D18F","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/18/89/76/d19287af.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1598493370,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":90044,"content":"哈哈哈，眼睛比较小的苦������","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"Leonard","uid":1119779,"ctime":1598622825,"ip_address":"","comment_id":244365,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100058801,"comment_content":"老师这眼睛有点像打拳击的","like_count":4,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1119779,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/11/16/23/99c7ede5.jpg","nickname":"张利兵","note":"","ucode":"DBAE17970AB143","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":504567,"discussion_content":"哈哈哈，眼睛比较小的苦������","content_length":17,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1598622825,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":296437,"user_name":"高山仰止","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1190305,"ip_address":"","ucode":"8C2E839345E734","user_he